{"text":"purananuru","n":334,"lines":["காகரு பழனக் கண்பின் அன்ன","தூமயிர்க் குறுந்தாள் நெடுஞ்செவிக் குறுமுயல்","புன்றலைச் சிறாஅர் மன்றத்து ஆர்ப்பின்","படப்புஒடுங் கும்மே … பின்பு …","… னூரே மனையோள்","பாணர் ஆர்த்தவும் பரிசிலர் ஓம்பவும்","ஊணொலி அரவமொடு கைதூ வாளே","உயர்மருப்பு யானைப் புகர்முகத்து அணிந்த","பொலம் … ப்","பரிசில் பரிசிலர்க்கு ஈய","உரவேற் காளையும் கைதூ வானே"],"tr":["kākaru paḻaṉak kaṇpiṉ aṉṉa","tūmayirk kuṟuntāḷ neṭuñcevik kuṟumuyal","puṉṟalaic ciṟāar maṉṟattu ārppiṉ","paṭappuoṭuṅ kummē piṉpu","ṉūrē maṉaiyōḷ","pāṇar ārttavum paricilar ōmpavum","ūṇoli aravamoṭu kaitū vāḷē","uyarmaruppu yāṉaip pukarmukattu aṇinta","polam p","paricil paricilarkku īya","uravēṟ kāḷaiyum kaitū vāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"vākai","tinai_ta":"வாகை","turai_ta":"மூதின் முல்லை","poet_ta":"மதுரைத் தமிழக் கூத்தனார்","poet_tr":"Maturait Tamiḻak Kūttaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"iṇaikkuṟaḷ āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"11 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"7×4, 2×3, 2×2 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 35, other 2, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 22, veṇṭaḷai 13, ? 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"காகரு","tr":"kākaru","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கரு","tr":"karu"}]},{"text":"பழனக்","tr":"paḻaṉak","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பழ","tr":"paḻa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னக்","tr":"ṉak"}]},{"text":"கண்பி","tr":"kaṇpi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பி","tr":"pi"}]},{"text":"னன்ன","tr":"ṉaṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னன்","tr":"ṉaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]}],[{"text":"தூமயிர்க்","tr":"tūmayirk","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூ","tr":"tū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மயிர்க்","tr":"mayirk"}]},{"text":"குறுந்தாள்","tr":"kuṟuntāḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text"